# FILEEDIT.LNK -- on the SBC:  LINK99 @FILEEDIT.LNK
# FILESTAT is named first: it carries the entry, which must land at
# >1000.  The rest of FileEdit's resident code comes from FILEEDIT.LIB,
# the runtime from IOLIB99.LIB - libraries, so the SBC needs few files.
# The libraries come before the overlays, so every member is placed below
# them.  OVL_PASTE and OVL_NAMEIO keep their long names here and in the
# map; the SBC opens them as OVL_PAST.R99 and OVL_NAME.R99.
-O1000 -S -YFEMAP.TXT FILEEDIT.EXE
FILESTAT.R99
FILEEDIT.LIB IOLIB99.LIB CLIB99.LIB
OVL_WORD.R99 OVL_CHAR.R99 OVL_RPT.R99 OVL_VIEW.R99 OVL_EDIT.R99
OVL_PASTE.R99 OVL_NAMEIO.R99
